  {
   "text": "Compared with the original code after 3 declared compatibility patches, not with its published GPU runs.",
   "src": "stage3/attempt-1/files/patches.json"
  },
  {
   "text": "Two synthetic CPU cases of 8 and 10 bags, 1 to 12 instances each, 8 and 16-dimensional. No real tissue was in this comparison.",
