  },
  {
   "text": "The CNN was replaced on both sides by a provisional decision, so the original image path was never compared.",
   "src": "stage3/accepted.json, limitations"
  },
  {
   "text": "12 decisions along the way were answered by the agent and marked provisional. No lab member has confirmed them.",
   "src": "answers.json"
  },
  {
   "text": "An agent wrote the comparison tests and the tool checked them with tamper runs. The independent verifier built on Oct 27 lists only clam, so it has not judged this method.",
